  "details": "The scaling options for nameplates changes the scaling of chatboxs. It dones't overwrite the chatbox scaling setting, but changes the baseline of it. Both settings are in MM > Setting > UI\n\nIf this is unintentional behaviour, then it would need to be fix.\n\nIf this is intentional behaviour, the the tooltips string `Change the size of nameplates.` 14783 would need to revisioned for clearification.\n\nThe issue was identified on build 1355, but it seem the issue has persisted for a while.\n\nLocalization Discord discussion on the topic:\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1154207112176607275/1162647889969958943",
